ASSOC From Indianapolis, by Broad Ripple, Carmel, Eagle
town, Boxley, Normandy and Alto, TO Kokomo,
45 miles and back, once week.

Leave Indianapolis every Thursday at 8 am;
Arrive at Kokomo next day by 11 am.

Leave Kokomo every Friday at 1 pm;
Arrive at Indianapolis next day by 6 pm.
Proposals for twice-a-week service, and ending at
Eagletown, invited.
14507 From Indianapolis by Cement, Brownsburg, Pitts
borough, Jamestown, New Ross, and Mace, To
Charlottesville, 82 miles and back, once week.
Leave Indianapolis every Saturday at 6 am;
Arrive at Charlottesville same day by 5 pm;
Leave Charlottesville Friday at 5 am;
Arrive at Indianapolis same day by 5 pm.
Proposals for more frequent service will be consid-
ered.
14506 From Indianapolis by Sugar Creek, Kinder, Davis
ville, Morristown, and Beech Grove to Rushville,
80 miles and back, once week.

Leave Indianapolis every Saturday at 11 am;
Arrive at Rushville same day by 5 pm;
Leave Rushville every Friday at 11 am;
Arrive at Indianapolis same day by 5 pm.
Proposals for weekly service will be considered.
14509 From Indianapolis, by Olive, Glenns Valley, Far
West, Martinsville, and Bryant's Creek, to Bloom
ington, 81 miles and back, twice week.
Leave Indianapolis Tuesday and Friday at 8 am;
Arrive at Bloomington same day by 5 m;
Leave Bloomington Wednesday and Saturday at 3 pm;
Arrive at Indianapolis same day by 5 pm.
Proposals for weekly service are invited.
14510 From Indianapolis, by Augusta, Eagle Village,
Northfield, Kinks Cross Roads, Michigantown,
Middlefork, Burlington, Carroll, and Deer Creek,
to Logansport 111 miles and back, once week.
Leave Indianapolis every Thursday at 1 am;
Arrive at Logansport next day by 11 m;
Leave Logansport Friday at 1 p m;

Arrive at Indianapolis next day by 8 pm.
Proposals for more frequent trips will be considered
also, for ending at Monticello.
14511 From Indianapolis by Mooresville, Monrovia 65
miles and back twice week.

